{
  "_about": "HAND-AUTHORED (origin:5e, 2026-10-30). Bad Eden 5E replaces the SRD Background with the Archetype (Dave 2026-10-30: 'It should be the thing that provides stat bonuses'). Each row becomes a dnd5e `background` item in pack bad-eden-5e.archetypes, so the sheet's background slot shows the Archetype's name and card. It does the 2024 background's job: +2/+1 (or +1/+1/+1) across three abilities, two skills (the Tier 1 skills, through the rubric skill table), one Origin feat, then grants the Archetype's own items from bad-eden-5e.character-archetypes: the base card + Tier 1 at level 0, Tier 2/3/4 at levels 5/11/17. Prose = the base card's quote + lede (pulled at build time). abilities = DRAFT for Dave's review; skills follow RFI canon (Moon's second skill, Arcana, is a 5E pick: RFI gives Lore only).",
